WEBVTT

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:16.160
<v Proog>At the left

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:23.400
<v Proog>we can see, at the right we can see
the head snarlers, and everything is safe,

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.440
<v Proog><c.emphasis>perfectly</c> safe.
Emo?

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.440
<v Proog>Emo.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:29.760
<v Proog><c.key>Watch</c> <c.key>out!</c>

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:47.900
<v Proog>Are you hurt?

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:53.940
<v Emo>I don't think so.
You?

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:56.820
<v Proog>I'm okay.

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:01.220
<v Proog>Get up, Emo.
It's <c.key>not</c> <c.key>safe</c> here.

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:03.260
<v Proog>Let's go.

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:04.640
<v Emo>What's next?

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:07.380
<v Proog>You'll see.

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.020
<v Proog>You'll see.

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:17.920
<v Proog>Emo,
this way.

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:35.660
<v Proog>Follow me!

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:12.320
<v Proog>Hurry, Emo!

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:23.000
<v S3>Listen, listen.
Listen.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.308
<v Proog>You're not <c.key>paying</c> <c.key>attention.</c>

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:53.900
<v Emo>I just want to answer the phone.

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:57.200
<v Proog>Emo, look,
I mean, listen.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.960
<v Proog>You have to <c.key>learn</c> <c.key>to</c> <c.key>listen.</c>

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.540
<v Proog>This is not some game.
You,

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.160
<v Proog>I mean,
we could <c.key>easily</c> <c.key>die</c> out here.

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:11.180
<v Proog>Listen.

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:14.020
<v Proog>Listen to the <c.key>sounds</c> <c.key>of</c> <c.key>the</c> <c.key>machine.</c>

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:19.751
<v Proog>Listen to <c.key>your</c> <c.key>breathing.</c>

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.275
<v Emo>Well, don't you ever get tired of this?

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:30.700
<v Proog>Tired?

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:32.760
<v Proog>Emo, the machine is

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:37.080
<v Proog><c.key>like</c> <c.key>clockwork.</c>
One move out of place

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:38.980
<v Proog>and you're <c.key>ground</c> <c.key>to</c> <c.key>a</c> <c.key>pulp.</c>

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:46.220
<v Proog>But isn't there like pulp, Emo?
Is that what you want, pulp?

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.720
<v Proog>Emo,
your goal in life?

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:51.860
<v Proog><c.emphasis>Pulp?</c>

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.320
<v Proog>Emo,
<c.key>close</c> <c.key>your</c> <c.key>eyes.</c>

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:45.720
<v Proog>Why? Now.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.220
<v Proog>Okay. Good.

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:02.525
<v Proog>What do you see at your left side,
Emo? Well...

00:06:04.384 --> 00:06:05.464
<v Proog>Nothing, really.

00:06:06.684 --> 00:06:07.802
<v Emo>No, nothing at all,

00:06:07.844 --> 00:06:09.784
<v Proog>really.
And at your right,

00:06:09.924 --> 00:06:12.277
<v Proog>what do you see at your right side, Emo?

00:06:13.784 --> 00:06:14.784
<v Emo>The same, Proog.

00:06:15.864 --> 00:06:16.864
<v Emo><c.emphasis>Exactly</c> the same.

00:06:17.084 --> 00:06:19.004
<v Emo><c.emphasis>Nothing.</c>
Great.

00:06:40.644 --> 00:06:42.564
<v Emo>Listen, Proog, do you hear that?

00:06:43.664 --> 00:06:44.664
<v Emo>Can we go here?

00:06:45.584 --> 00:06:46.004
<v Proog>There?

00:06:46.004 --> 00:06:48.024
<v Emo>Yeah,
it isn't safe, Emo.

00:06:49.644 --> 00:06:50.644
<v Emo>Well, but

00:06:50.684 --> 00:06:52.024
<v Proog><c.key>trust</c> <c.key>me,</c> it's not.

00:06:53.284 --> 00:06:54.696
<v Emo>Well maybe I could go...

00:06:54.724 --> 00:06:55.724
<v Proog>No.

00:06:57.444 --> 00:06:58.084
<v S3>But...

00:06:58.084 --> 00:06:59.044
<v Proog><c.emphasis>No!</c>

00:06:59.444 --> 00:07:00.444
<v Proog><c.emphasis>No!</c>

00:07:01.284 --> 00:07:03.124
<v Proog>Any further questions, Emo?

00:07:04.604 --> 00:07:05.604
<v Emo>No.

00:07:09.884 --> 00:07:10.884
<v Proog>Emo.

00:07:10.904 --> 00:07:11.824
<v Emo>Yeah.

00:07:11.824 --> 00:07:12.824
<v Proog>Emo, why?

00:07:13.824 --> 00:07:15.204
<v Proog>Emo,
why?

00:07:15.604 --> 00:07:18.324
<v Proog>Why can't you see
the <c.key>beauty</c> <c.key>of</c> <c.key>this</c> <c.key>place?</c>

00:07:19.104 --> 00:07:20.544
<v Proog>The way it works,

00:07:21.864 --> 00:07:23.524
<v Proog>how <c.emphasis>perfect</c> it is.

00:07:24.604 --> 00:07:26.824
<v Emo>No, Proog,
I don't see.

00:07:27.504 --> 00:07:29.975
<v Emo>I don't see because there's <c.key>nothing</c> <c.key>there.</c>

00:07:31.584 --> 00:07:35.173
<v Emo>And why should I <c.key>trust</c> <c.key>my</c> <c.key>life</c>
to something that isn't there?

00:07:35.664 --> 00:07:38.194
<v Emo>Well, can you tell me that?
Emo. Answer me.

00:07:43.764 --> 00:07:44.764
<v Emo>Proog,

00:07:45.524 --> 00:07:46.583
<v Emo>you're <c.key>a</c> <c.key>sick</c> <c.key>man.</c>

00:07:46.784 --> 00:07:47.524
<v Proog>Emo.

00:07:47.524 --> 00:07:48.583
<v Emo>Stay away from me.

00:07:48.604 --> 00:07:49.604
<v Proog>Emo.

00:07:52.604 --> 00:07:54.544
<v Proog>No, Emo, it's <c.key>a</c> <c.key>trap.</c>

00:07:56.104 --> 00:07:57.104
<v Emo>It's a trap.

00:07:57.624 --> 00:08:01.404
<v Emo>At the left side you can see
the Hanging Gardens of Babylon.

00:08:02.224 --> 00:08:03.519
<v Emo>How's that for a trap?

00:08:05.984 --> 00:08:06.984
<v S3>No, Emo.

00:08:09.424 --> 00:08:11.307
<v Emo>On the right side you can see...

00:08:11.704 --> 00:08:14.624
<v Emo><c.soft>Well,</c> guess what?
The Colossus of Rhodes.

00:08:15.804 --> 00:08:17.764
<v Emo>No! The Colossus of Rhodes.

00:08:18.084 --> 00:08:21.484
<v Emo>And it is here just for you, Proog.
<c.emphasis>Just</c> <c.emphasis>for</c> <c.emphasis>you.</c>

00:08:51.264 --> 00:08:52.504
<v Proog>It is <c.emphasis>there.</c>

00:08:53.904 --> 00:08:55.744
<v Proog>I'm telling you,
Emo.

00:08:57.384 --> 00:08:59.424
<v Proog>It is.
It is.
